    {
      "beat_id": "B05",
      "act": "SUMMARY",
      "role_note": "the rule",
      "narration_text": "The rule is to treat a zero, or a low count, as a claim to check. Search the raw files for the word the script is looking for, in every chapter that reports nothing, and read what comes back, including the false alarms.",
